[{"title":"初冬拜外太祖墓","author":"王微","text":"松径看成远，烟寒鸟一鸣。\n应知泉下客，仍在此山行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1101,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜送别","author":"王微","text":"握手应无语，离亭日渐过。\n霜寒天不曙，月好梦无多。\n莫言君去急，妾思逐流波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1102,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过宛叔梦阁","author":"王微","text":"照返江流急，霜多枫叶残。\n年年月光好，只共一闺寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1103,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友夏友夏赠诗有天涯流落同之句","author":"王微","text":"去去应难问，寒空叶自红。\n此生已沦落，犹幸得君同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1104,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送远","author":"王微","text":"尔别何所游，月明江上舟。\n异日思君处，凭栏看水流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1105,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦宛叔","author":"王微","text":"泉声乍远雨声闻，残睡昏昏梦到君。\n最是梦醒无意绪，暗推窗看水边云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1106,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"问侍儿月上花梢几许","author":"王微","text":"晚香澹澹出花枝，清夜窗纱坐起迟。\n最爱月明愁见月，月痕犹喜侍儿知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1107,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昌化道中","author":"王微","text":"照返烟溪树影斜，千山含翠暮云遮。\n年来已自多愁绪，古道无人更落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1108,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中偶拈","author":"王微","text":"秋清寂无事，卧病竹间房。\n日晚庭风落，时闻药草香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1109,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶赋","author":"王微","text":"月落寒流急，风微桐影斜。\n更堪霜里雁，飞过少年家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1110,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹阳道中作","author":"王微","text":"雨歇山愈碧，杨花拂拂飞。\n幽人偶无趣，似是惜春归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1111,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游牛首阅春江即目","author":"王微","text":"初晴开柳色，忽照片樯悬。\n林远莺声倦，江流月影圆。\n馀花绣崖谷，幽翠染云烟。\n雨带前朝梦，春留昨日妍。\n平洲双镜合，灵院一灯然。\n只此佳游际，疑参雪后禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1112,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬夜渡江","author":"王微","text":"楚云天际似相邀，旅思无端斗泬。\n篙影没寒灯寂寂，树声留咽岸萧萧。\n波从去雁分斜月，人共栖乌匝半宵。\n一片离心烟共水，江南江北自归潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1113,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"王微","text":"寒沙日午雾犹含，萧瑟风光三月三。\n扑地柳花新燕子，不由人不忆江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1114,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长至入云栖","author":"王微","text":"晴日寒江路，松云入望深。\n身香燃五分，行树拔千寻。\n忍土如家舍，交光映夙心。\n还疑晏坐处，犹发妙严音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1115,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居","author":"王微","text":"桃嫣李笑满园春，何事无聊似病身。\n独坐水边残照落，定风幡下候花神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1116,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜二绝句 其一","author":"王微","text":"凄切秋声虫络丝，入帘残月似蛾眉。\n愁心不逐闲云散，长比寒沟月照时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1117,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜二绝句 其二","author":"王微","text":"何处鸣蜩不可怜，霜闺摇落夜无眠。\n题残纨扇光疑月，多少人间不共圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1118,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄外","author":"梅生","text":"落叶满庭阶，秋风吹复起。\n遥忆别离人，寂寞何堪此。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1119,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新嘉驿题壁二首 其一","author":"会稽女郎","text":"银红衫子半蒙尘，一盏孤灯伴此身。\n恰似梨花经雨后，可怜零落旧时春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1120,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新嘉驿题壁二首 其二","author":"会稽女郎","text":"万种忧愁诉与谁，对人强笑背人悲。\n此时莫把寻常看，一句诗成千泪垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1121,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆家园一绝","author":"赛涛","text":"日望南云泪湿衣，家园梦想见依稀。\n短墙曲巷池边屋，罗汉松青对紫薇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1122,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元宵","author":"赛涛","text":"满城箫鼓元宵节，小馆灯花孤闷时。\n料得团圞行坐处，有人挥泪说分离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1123,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春阴诗","author":"徐氏（金陵妓","text":"杨花厚处春阴薄，清冷不胜单裌衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1124,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客座分咏得骰子","author":"正德间妓","text":"一片寒微骨，翻成面面心。\n自从遭点污，抛掷到如今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1125,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人","author":"朱斗儿","text":"杨子江边送玉郎，柳丝牵挽柳条长。\n柳丝换得行人住，多向江头种两行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1126,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中别禹锡于藤溪","author":"周青霞","text":"寒林落日倚枯藤，泪洒清溪红欲冰。\n此际与君为别去，好寻松柏到西陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1127,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金白屿王仲房沈嘉则九日醵金会饮赋诗见赠即席和答","author":"赵丽华","text":"少小秦楼学燕飞，楚云湘水见应稀。\n欣逢此日重阳酒，还整当年旧舞衣。\n结客自怜非赵侠，靓妆无复是南威。\n劝君未醉休辞醉，细插黄花且莫归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1128,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答人寄吴笺","author":"赵丽华","text":"感君寄吴笺，笺上双飞鹊。\n但效鹊双飞，不效吴笺薄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1129,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴郎","author":"王儒卿","text":"旧事巫山一梦中，佳期回首竟成空。\n郎心亦是浮萍草，莫怪杨花易逐风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1130,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花源逢顾何二使君作","author":"姜舜玉","text":"仙源深几曲，夹岸桃花开。\n忽漫逢刘阮，殷勤劝酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1131,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊濠曲","author":"姜舜玉","text":"芙蓉带结红鹓蒂，杨柳丝牵紫燕飞。\n独掉兰舟何处宿，年年飘泊待郎归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1132,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺情 其一","author":"景翩翩","text":"飞飞双蛱蝶，底事过邻家。\n邻家海棠树，春来已见花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1133,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺情 其二","author":"景翩翩","text":"忆自折杨柳，长亭赠玉骢。\n如今杨花白，日日解随风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1134,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺情 其三","author":"景翩翩","text":"夜静还未眠，蛩吟遽难歇。\n无那一片心，说向云间月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1135,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺情 其四","author":"景翩翩","text":"窗前六出花，心与寒风折。\n不是郎归迟，郎处无冰雪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1136,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五日泛舟得男字","author":"景翩翩","text":"浴罢试冰蚕，重扶碧玉簪。\n操舟临雒水，作赋吊湘潭。\n曲误郎应顾，卢回客自酣。\n此时论黛色，谁复斗宜男。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1137,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晏起","author":"景翩翩","text":"晏起茶香解宿醺，阑干花气午氤氲。\n侍儿指点湘帘外，若个春山多白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1138,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与苏生话别 其一","author":"景翩翩","text":"十日平原酒，三秋江上船。\n一经摇落后，明月几回圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1139,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与苏生话别 其二","author":"景翩翩","text":"月出人未来，月缺人已去。\n好共借馀辉，相求直至曙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1140,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与苏生话别 其三","author":"景翩翩","text":"道是愁无极，还教仗醉魔。\n谁知醒时意，说向醉中多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1141,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"景翩翩","text":"楼前箫史忆吹箫，雁足西风倍寂寥。\n望断支机应化石，愁填乌鹊未成桥。\n素毫月冷吟梧叶，纨扇秋回识柳条。\n姊妹东邻如乞巧，莫教瓜果浪相招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1142,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"景翩翩","text":"柳底繁阴月易藏，无端寒露泣寒螀。\n残秋莫坐空堂夜，二十五声点点长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1143,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟发沙溪","author":"景翩翩","text":"青溪九曲白云乡，溪上行舟款乃长。\n谁把金丸打野鸭，偏惊几处睡鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1144,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写兰 其二","author":"景翩翩","text":"但吹花信风，莫作妒花雨。\n我欲采琼枝，换得同心住。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1145,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雨","author":"景翩翩","text":"风雨滞残春，岂但梨花闷。\n梦里万重山，叠起江南恨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1146,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞蓬","author":"景翩翩","text":"飞蓬羞倚合欢床，明月如冰夜欲霜。\n梦里新翻云髻样，暗尘铺满凤凰箱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1147,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"襄阳蹋铜蹄 其一","author":"景翩翩","text":"郎自襄阳人，惯饮襄阳酒。\n未醉向郎言，郎醒应回首。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1148,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"襄阳蹋铜蹄 其二","author":"景翩翩","text":"汉水自盈盈，男儿自远征。\n不知别后梦，底夜到宜城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1149,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"襄阳蹋铜蹄 其三","author":"景翩翩","text":"骏马蹋铜蹄，金羁艳陇西。\n郎应重意气，妾岂向人啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1150,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月一日雨","author":"景翩翩","text":"九十春光已暗过，雕阑花信竟如何。\n应知雨意和愁约，雨到床头愁亦多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1151,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张孝廉","author":"景翩翩","text":"柳丝细织晓烟青，恻恻春寒长短亭。\n马度山腰蹄尚懒，湿云如梦未全醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1152,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"休洗红 其一","author":"景翩翩","text":"休洗红，洗多红色减。\n色减无时归，质弱难重染。\n祗将红泪共流东，褪却无由缀落红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1153,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"休洗红 其二","author":"景翩翩","text":"休洗红，洗多渐成故。\n能无故色殊，番将新色妒。\n新新故故递相因，莫教浅淡尤它人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1154,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲 其一","author":"景翩翩","text":"十里湖如镜，红莲个个香。\n大姑先戏水，荡散两鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1155,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲 其二","author":"景翩翩","text":"小姑采莲花，莫漫采莲藕。\n采藕柳丝长，问姑姑知否？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1156,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月即事","author":"景翩翩","text":"三月春无味，杨花惹晓风。\n莫行流水岸，片片是残红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1157,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"女儿子 其一","author":"景翩翩","text":"哀猿一声夜未半，峡峡柔肠寸寸断。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1158,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"女儿子 其二","author":"景翩翩","text":"回川逆折声潺潺，枕边流泪摧朱颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1159,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安东平 其一","author":"景翩翩","text":"西风吹衣，北风吹面。\n郎既相迎，郎心未变。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1160,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安东平 其二","author":"景翩翩","text":"驱车终日，留侬喘息。\n徐语向郎，郎意毋亟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1161,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安东平 其三","author":"景翩翩","text":"遗郎尺锦，是侬寸心。\n十日一线，五日一针。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1162,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安东平 其四","author":"景翩翩","text":"郎心不穷，报以温语。\n既郎此情，胜多多许。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1163,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安东平 其五","author":"景翩翩","text":"明神在右，明月在天。\n神愿鉴止，与月长圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1164,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泰宁病中","author":"景翩翩","text":"春日颦眉长闭门，东风吹雨倍销魂。\n不知野外垂丝柳，青入南头第几村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1165,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈生回文","author":"景翩翩","text":"箫吹静阁晓含情，片片飞花映日晴。\n寥寂泪痕双对枕，短长歌曲几调筝。\n桥垂绿柳侵眉淡，榻绕红云拂袖轻。\n遥望四山青极目，销魂黯处乱啼莺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1166,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画眉","author":"景翩翩","text":"莺去春如梦，梅黄雨尚痴。\n可堪明镜里，独自画蛾眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1167,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怨辞 其一","author":"景翩翩","text":"岂曰道路长，君怀自阻止。\n妾心亦车轮，日日万馀里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1168,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怨辞 其二","author":"景翩翩","text":"妾作溪中水，水流不离石。\n君心杨柳花，随风无定迹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1169,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野外","author":"景翩翩","text":"晓雨泉争向，春山莺乱啼。\n流云两三片，移过石桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1170,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青溪曲 其一","author":"景翩翩","text":"昨自建州来，侨住青溪北。\n纷纷白皙郎，群趋愿相识。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1171,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青溪曲 其二","author":"景翩翩","text":"日乘芙蓉车，七贵相尔汝。\n妾本吴中人，好就吴侬语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1172,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青溪曲 其三","author":"景翩翩","text":"石桥横溪水，华月流青天。\n桥上步罗袜，可是凌波仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1173,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青溪曲 其四","author":"景翩翩","text":"与欢深夜归，小妹调筝歇。\n并坐结同心，引到楼头月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1174,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小垂手","author":"景翩翩","text":"金罍溢倡酬，媚眼转惊秋。\n折腰随鹭下，垂手与龙游。\n夸容未再理，明月在西楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1175,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃叶歌","author":"景翩翩","text":"侬自唤桃叶，侬只似桃花。\n花花容易落，郎去宿谁家？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1176,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄远 其一","author":"景翩翩","text":"驱车一以疾，相见何迟迟。\n思君平昔意，不似薄情儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1177,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄远 其二","author":"景翩翩","text":"江上望归棹，君归未有期。\n试看圆缺月，是侬断肠时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1178,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄情十四韵","author":"景翩翩","text":"握粟詹予美，端蓍竟我欺。\n前鱼如未弃，下凤故应迟。\n荏苒惊吹律，凄凉忆履綦。\n漫餐妃子秀，虚啮舍人饴。\n懒去初侵鬓，颦回恰到眉。\n泪痕留琥珀，花胜淡燕支。\n露遣冰纨冷，风传画角悲。\n题盘缘伯玉，捣素事班姬。\n苦海填愁遍，盟山著恨移。\n秋深仍系帛，日入已栖埘。\n石阙何能解，刀头尚可期。\n三缘经曲折，五内几妍媸。\n尘掩菱花镜，心摇桂叶旗。\n何妨梁下信，更作有情痴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1179,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"解嘲","author":"景翩翩","text":"闺中自昔论红线，侠气纵横频掣电。\n来作处女君未知，去矣脱兔容谁见。\n世上徒夸屋是金，明珠换骨不换心。\n一自临邛罢绿绮，只今千载无知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1180,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]